 templates in the Site Editor.'=>'Ṣatunkọ akọle lori oju-iwe ọja Cart aiyipada. Fun apẹrẹ pipin, ṣeto aworan ti a ṣe afihan lori ọja lati yi abẹlẹ pada. Ṣatunkọ awọn awoṣe bulọọki aṣa ninu Ẹlẹda Aaye.','Payment plans'=>'Àwọn ètò ìsanwo','Customers choose one of these plans at checkout.'=>'Àwọn oníbàárà yan ọkan lára ​​àwọn ètò wọ̀nyí ni àkóónú.','Sale'=>'Tita','Enter a sale price in each payment plan you want to discount.'=>'Tẹ iye tita kan ni ọkọọkan awọn eto isanwo ti o fẹ lati ṣe ẹdinwo.','Sales limits'=>'Ìdíye tita','Checkout window'=>'Àwòrán àkóónú','Open and close the checkout form on set dates.'=>'Ṣí àti pa fọọ́mù àkóónú ni ọjọ́ tí a ṣètò.','When checkout is closed'=>'Nígbà tí àkóónú bá ti pa','Before it opens, after it ends, or when stock runs out.'=>'Kíá tó ṣí, lẹ́yìn tó parí, tàbí nígbà tí ìpamọ́ ba parí.','Form fields'=>'Àwọn pẹpẹ fọọ́mù','Button and checkboxes'=>'Bọtini àti àṣàyàn','Opt-in checkbox'=>'Àṣàyàn opt-in','Ask for consent before customers join a mailing list.'=>'Beere fun ìmúrasí kí àwọn oníbàárà tó darapọ mọ àtòjọ ìmélì.','Default emails'=>'Awọn imeeli aiyipada','Turn an email off to skip it for this product only.'=>'Pa imeeli kan mọ lati foju kọ ọ fun ọja yii nikan.','Custom notifications'=>'Awọn ikilọ aṣa','Send more emails when someone buys this product.'=>'Ran awọn imeeli diẹ sii nigbati ẹnikan ba ra ọja yii.','Use integrations to add customers to mailing lists or run actions in connected services when an order or subscription event occurs. Connect your services in Cart settings, then choose a service and trigger below.'=>'Lo awọn ifaminsi lati fi awọn alabara kun awọn atokọ imeeli tabi ṣe awọn iṣe ni awọn iṣẹ ti o so pọ nigbati iṣẹ-ṣẹ tabi iṣẹ-abọ ba ṣẹlẹ. So awọn iṣẹ rẹ pọ ni awọn eto Kẹfa, lẹhinna yan iṣẹ kan ki o si fa a silẹ ni isalẹ.','+ Add integration'=>'+ Fi ifaminsi kun','Edit integration'=>'Ṣatunkọ ifaminsi','Integration'=>'Isopọ','Remove integration'=>'Yọ ifaminsi','No integrations yet'=>'Ko si awọn ifaminsi sibẹsibẹ','Add one to send customers to a mailing list or another service when they buy.'=>'Fi ọkan kun lati ran awọn alabara si atokọ imeeli tabi iṣẹ miiran nigbati wọn ba ra.','Refresh mailing lists'=>'Tun awọn atokọ imeeli ṣe','Get new lists, groups and tags from your connected services.'=>'Gba awọn atokọ tuntun, awọn ẹgbẹ ati awọn aami lati awọn iṣẹ ti o so pọ.','-- Select Membership Level --'=>'-- Yan Ipele Ìforúkọsílẹ --','-- no options found --'=>'-- kò sí aṣayan tí a rí --','No Groups Found'=>'Kò Sí Àwọn Ẹgbẹ́ Tí A Rí','Select'=>'Yan','-- Select --'=>'-- Yan --','-- select --'=>'-- yan --','none'=>'ko si','Product purchased'=>'Ọja ti ra','Product refunded'=>'Ọja ti sanpada','COD order created'=>'Aṣẹ COD ti ṣẹda','Subscription active'=>'Iṣẹ-abọ ti n ṣiṣẹ','Installment plan completed'=>'Eto isanwo ti pari','Subscription canceled'=>'Iṣẹ-abọ ti fagile','Subscription paused'=>'Iṣẹ-abọ ti da duro','Subscription renewal charged'=>'Iwe-ẹri iṣẹ-abọ ti gba owo','Subscription renewal failed'=>'Iwe-ẹri iṣẹ-abọ ko ni aṣeyọri','No plans found'=>'Ko si awọn eto ti a ri','Background color'=>'Awọ abẹlẹ','Enter price'=>'Tẹ iye','Existing payment plan'=>'Eto isanwo to wa tẹlẹ','One-time plans only.'=>'Awọn eto igba kan ṣoṣo.','Product image'=>'Aworan ọja','Remove image'=>'Yọ aworan','Set image'=>'Ṣeto aworan','Image position'=>'Ipo aworan','Left'=>'Osi','Top'=>'Orilẹ-ede','Checkbox label'=>'Aami apoti ayẹwo','Headline'=>'Iṣẹ́-ìlà','Product description'=>'Apejuwe ọja','Run only for customers who opt in.'=>'Ṣe nikan fun awọn alabara ti o yan.','Turn on Show opt-in checkbox first.'=>'Tan-an Fihan apoti ayẹwo akọkọ.','Require consent'=>'Beere ifọwọsi','Shown on the product page, orders, emails and Stripe payments.'=>'Fihan lori oju-iwe ọja, awọn aṣẹ, awọn imeeli ati awọn sisanwo Stripe.','Public product name'=>'Orukọ ọja ti gbangba','Leave empty to use the main product title'=>'Fi ṣofo lati lo akọle ọja akọkọ','Hide the name in the product page header.'=>'Pa orukọ naa mọ ni akọle oju-iwe ọja.','Hide page title'=>'Pa akọle oju-iwe mọ','Header background color'=>'Awọ abẹlẹ akọle','Header background image'=>'Aworan abẹlẹ akọle','Until canceled'=>'Titi di ipinnu',' payments'=>' sisanwo','Hide this plan on checkout forms.'=>'Pa eto yii mọ lori awọn fọọmu sisanwo.','At least one plan must stay visible.'=>'O kere ju eto kan gbọdọ wa ni kedere.','Hidden'=>'Hidden','First Name '=>'Oruko akọkọ ','Last Name'=>'Oruko idile','Address '=>'Adirẹsi ','Address2 '=>'Adirẹsi2 ','City '=>'Ilu ','State '=>'Ipinle ','Zip '=>'Zip ','Order Status'=>'Ipo aṣẹ','Subscription Status'=>'Ipo Ìforúkọsílẹ','Unsaved changes'=>'Àtúnṣe tí kò ṣàgbékalẹ̀','Save changes'=>'Fipamọ́ àtúnṣe','And'=>'Ati','Or'=>'TABI','+ Add another condition'=>'+ Fi ipo miiran kun','Edit Field'=>'Edit Field','Media Library'=>'Ile-ikawe Media','Custom Tax Rates'=>'Iwọn Owo-ori Adani','Define country, state, postcode, and city-specific rates used during checkout.'=>'Ṣe alaye awọn orilẹ-ede, ipinlẹ, koodu ifiweranṣẹ, ati awọn oṣuwọn ti ilu-ni pato ti a lo nigba ti a n ra.','Search tax rates'=>'Wa awọn oṣuwọn owo-ori','Search rates...'=>'Wa awọn oṣuwọn...','Country code'=>'Koodu orilẹ-ede','State code'=>'Koodu ipinlẹ','Postcode'=>'Koodu ifiweranṣẹ','Rate %'=>'Oṣuwọn %','Tax Title'=>'Ak Title owo-ori','Priority'=>'Ipo','Insert row'=>'Fi ila kun','Remove selected row(s)'=>'Yọ ila ti a yan(k)','Save Tax Rates'=>'Fipamọ awọn oṣuwọn owo-ori','Import CSV'=>'Gbe CSV wọle','Export CSV'=>'Gbe CSV jade','Loading&hellip;'=>'Nṣiṣẹ&hellip;','%s Settings'=>'%s Eto','No payment methods found!'=>'Ko si awọn ọna isanwo ti a rii!','Please enable at least one payment method in the'=>'Jọwọ muu ṣiṣẹ o kere ju ọna isanwo kan ni','PublishPress Cart settings'=>'eto Káàtì PublishPress','Pages'=>'Oju-iwe','Branding'=>'Branding','Payment Methods'=>'Awọn ọna isanwo','Invoices'=>'Ìwé-ìfowopamọ','Downloads'=>'Awọn igbasilẹ','Debug'=>'Iṣakoso aṣiṣe','Maintenance'=>'Itọju','White Label'=>'Aami Funfun','Currency and pricing defaults for your store.'=>'Iye owo ati awọn idiyele aiyipada fun ile itaja rẹ.','Choose the customer account page and policy links.'=>'Yan oju-iwe iroyin onibara ati awọn ọna asopọ ilanu.','Set the company details and logo used across customer documents.'=>'Ṣeto awọn alaye ile-iṣẹ ati aami ti a lo ni gbogbo awọn iwe onibara.','Choose which gateways accept payments and configure their keys.'=>'Yan awọn ẹnu-ọna wo ni o gba awọn isanwo ati tunto awọn bọtini wọn.','Configure tax rules and tax rates that apply at checkout.'=>'Tunto awọn ofin owo-ori ati awọn oṣuwọn owo-ori ti o wulo ni akoko isanwo.','Customize how invoices look and what details they include.'=>'Ṣe aṣa bi awọn ìwé-ìfowopamọ ṣe wo ati kini awọn alaye ti wọn ni.','Configure secure file download access and URL behavior.'=>'Tunto iraye si gbigba faili ti o ni aabo ati ihuwasi URL.','Tune sender details, test messages and customer notifications.'=>'Tunto awọn alaye oluranse, idanwo awọn ifiranṣẹ ati awọn akiyesi onibara.','Connect your store with marketing, analytics and automation tools.'=>'So ile itaja rẹ pọ pẹlu awọn irinṣẹ tita, itupalẹ ati adaṣiṣẹ.','Run a referral program with affiliate tracking, commissions, and payouts.'=>'Ṣe eto itọkasi pẹlu atẹle alabaṣiṣẹpọ, awọn ikọkọ, ati awọn isanwo.','Configure sales report recipients and email schedules.'=>'Ṣe atunṣe awọn olugba iroyin tita ati awọn eto imeeli.','Enable diagnostic logging and access debug log tools.'=>'Mu igbasilẹ iwadii ṣiṣẹ ati wọle si awọn irinṣẹ igbasilẹ aṣiṣe.','Operational tools including security encryption and credential migration.'=>'Awọn irinṣẹ iṣẹ pẹlu aabo ikọkọ ati gbigbe ẹri.','Configure store options that do not belong in the main setup tabs.'=>'Ṣe atunṣe awọn aṣayan ile itaja ti ko ni ibamu ninu awọn taabu eto akọkọ.','Configure plugin branding, menu labels and white-label documentation links.'=>'Ṣeto ami iyasọtọ plugin, awọn aami akojọ aṣayan ati awọn ọna asopọ iwe-aṣẹ funfun.','Store'=>'Ile itaja','Communication & Tools'=>'Ib Communication & Irinṣẹ','More'=>'Siwaju sii','ActiveCampaign'=>'ActiveCampaign','Sync customers and purchases to ActiveCampaign.'=>'Sopọ awọn alabara ati awọn rira si ActiveCampaign.','Mailchimp'=>'Mailchimp','Add customers to Mailchimp audiences and automate emails.'=>'Fi awọn alabara kun awọn olugbo Mailchimp ki o si ṣe awọn imeeli laifọwọyi.','Kit'=>'Kit','Send customers and purchases to Kit forms and tags.'=>'Ran awọn alabara ati awọn rira si awọn fọọmu ati awọn ami Kit.','MemberVault'=>'MemberVault','Protect content and manage members with MemberVault.'=>'Daabobo akoonu ati ṣakoso awọn ọmọ ẹgbẹ pẹlu MemberVault.','SendFox'=>'SendFox','Grow your audience and send automated emails with SendFox.'=>'Gba awọn olugbo rẹ pọ si ki o si ran awọn imeeli laifọwọyi pẹlu SendFox.','Facebook Ad Events'=>'Iṣẹlẹ Ipolowo Facebook','Send Cart events to an existing Meta Pixel or enter a Pixel ID to load it on checkout and paid confirmation pages.'=>'Firanṣẹ awọn iṣẹlẹ Cart si fifi sori Meta Pixel ti o wa tẹlẹ tabi tẹ ID Pixel lati gbe e lori oju-iwe rira ati awọn oju-iwe ijẹrisi isanwo.','Google Analytics'=>'Google Analytics','Send Cart events to an existing Google Analytics or Google Tag Manager installation. PublishPress Cart does not install or connect the analytics script.'=>'Ranṣẹ awọn iṣẹlẹ Cart si fifi sori Google Analytics tabi Google Tag Manager ti o wa. PublishPress Cart ko fi sori ẹrọ tabi sopọ si akọwe analytics.','Google reCAPTCHA'=>'Google reCAPTCHA','Protect checkout forms from spam and bot submissions.'=>'Daabobo fọọmu ìdíyelé lati spam ati ìròyìn bot.','Google reCAPTCHA v2'=>'Google reCAPTCHA v2','Configure checkbox or invisible reCAPTCHA v2 protection.'=>'Ṣeto apoti ayẹwo tabi aabo reCAPTCHA v2 ti ko han.','Google reCAPTCHA v3'=>'Google reCAPTCHA v3','Configure score-based reCAPTCHA v3 protection.'=>'Ṣeto aabo reCAPTCHA v3 ti o da lori awọn akọsilẹ.','Drip'=>'Drip','Sync customers, tags and ecommerce activity to Drip.'=>'Sopọ awọn onibara, awọn aami ati iṣẹ ecommerce si Drip.','Flodesk'=>'Flodesk','Add customers to Flodesk segments.'=>'Fi awọn onibara kun awọn ipin Flodesk.','MailerLite'=>'MailerLite','Add customers to MailerLite subscribers and groups.'=>'Fi awọn onibara kun si awọn alabapin ati awọn ẹgbẹ MailerLite.','MailPoet'=>'MailPoet','Add customers to MailPoet lists.'=>'Fi awọn onibara kun si awọn atokọ MailPoet.','Encharge'=>'Encharge','Track order events and sync customers to Encharge.'=>'Tẹle awọn iṣẹlẹ aṣẹ ati sopọ awọn onibara si Encharge.','FluentCRM'=>'FluentCRM','Add customers to FluentCRM lists and tags.'=>'Fi awọn onibara kun si awọn atokọ ati awọn aami FluentCRM.','Academy LMS'=>'Academy LMS','Enroll or remove students from Academy LMS courses.'=>'Forukọsilẹ tabi yọ awọn ọmọ ile-iwe kuro ninu awọn ẹkọ Academy LMS.','Gurucan'=>'Gurucan','Add or remove customers in Gurucan products.'=>'Fi awọn onibara kun tabi yọ wọn ni awọn ọja Gurucan.','Heartbeat'=>'Ibi-ibè','Manage community access in Heartbeat.'=>'Ṣakoso iraye si agbegbe ni Ibi-ibè.','Kajabi'=>'Kajabi','Enable Kajabi purchase automations.'=>'Mu awọn adaṣe rira Kajabi ṣiṣẹ.','Teachable'=>'Teachable','Enroll customers into Teachable schools and products.'=>'Forukọsilẹ awọn onibara sinu awọn ile-iwe ati awọn ọja Teachable.','Upcoach'=>'Upcoach','Grant customers access to Upcoach programs.'=>'Fun awọn onibara ni iraye si awọn eto Upcoach.','Tutor LMS'=>'Tutor LMS','Enroll or remove students from Tutor LMS courses.'=>'Forukọsilẹ tabi yọ awọn ọmọ ile-iwe kuro ninu awọn kọsitọmu Tutor LMS.','LearnDash'=>'LearnDash','Grant or revoke LearnDash course access.'=>'Fun tabi gba iraye si kọsitọmu LearnDash.','WP Courseware'=>'WP Courseware','Manage WP Courseware enrollments after purchase.'=>'Ṣakoso awọn iforukọsilẹ WP Courseware lẹhin rira.','MasterStudy LMS'=>'MasterStudy LMS','Enroll customers into MasterStudy LMS courses.'=>'Forukọsilẹ awọn onibara sinu awọn kọsitọmu MasterStudy LMS.','Groups'=>'Awọn Ẹgbẹ','Add or remove customers from WordPress Groups.'=>'Fi kun tabi yọ awọn onibara kuro ninu Awọn Ẹgbẹ WordPress.','MemberPress'=>'MemberPress','Grant customers MemberPress membership access.'=>'Fun awọn onibara ni iraye si ọmọ ẹgbẹ MemberPress.','ARMember'=>'ARMember','Grant customers ARMember plan access.'=>'Fun awọn onibara ni iraye si eto ARMember.','WishList Member'=>'WishList Member','Grant customers WishList Member level access.'=>'Fun awọn onibara ni iraye si ipele WishList Member.','Restrict Content Pro'=>'Restrict Content Pro','Grant customers Restrict Content Pro access.'=>'Fun awọn onibara ni iraye si Restrict Content Pro.','Ultimate Member'=>'Ultimate Member','Send Ultimate Member welcome emails for new customers.'=>'Rán awọn imeeli ikini Ultimate Member fun awọn onibara tuntun.','Elementor'=>'Elementor','Choose Elementor templates for checkout components.'=>'Yan awọn awoṣe Elementor fun awọn eroja isanwo.','Divi'=>'Divi','Use PublishPress Cart order forms inside Divi layouts.'=>'Lo awọn fọọmu aṣẹ PublishPress Cart ninu awọn apẹrẹ Divi.','Oxygen Builder'=>'Oxygen Builder','Use PublishPress Cart conditions in Oxygen Builder.'=>'Lo awọn ipo PublishPress Cart ninu Oxygen Builder.','Gutenberg'=>'Gutenberg','Use PublishPress Cart blocks in the WordPress block editor.'=>'Lo awọn bulọọki PublishPress Cart ninu olootu bulọọki WordPress.','WooCommerce'=>'WooCommerce','Connect PublishPress Cart products with WooCommerce flows.'=>'So awọn ọja PublishPress Cart pọ pẹlu awọn ṣiṣan WooCommerce.','WP Domain Checker'=>'WP Domain Checker','Sell domains through WP Domain Checker checkout flows.'=>'Ta awọn agbegbe nipasẹ awọn ṣiṣan isanwo WP Domain Checker.','Cancel an existing subscription as an order automation.'=>'Fagilee ìforúkọsílẹ tó wà gẹ́gẹ́ bí ìmúlò àṣẹ.','Refund Order'=>'Pàdà Owó Ìṣẹ́','Refund an existing order as an order automation.'=>'Pàdà ìṣẹ́ tó wà gẹ́gẹ́ bí ìmúlò àṣẹ.','Webhook'=>'Webhook','Send order data to an external webhook URL.'=>'Rán data ìṣẹ́ sí URL webhook ti ita.','All'=>'Gbogbo','Email Marketing'=>'Ìpolówó Imeeli','Analytics'=>'