ba ti yan ni akoko ifijiṣẹ)','From'=>'Lati','To'=>'Si','You do not have permission to reset this email template.'=>'Iwọ ko ni aṣẹ lati tun awoṣe imeeli yii ṣe.','Email template could not be reset.'=>'A ko le tun awoṣe imeeli ṣe.','Using default'=>'Lilo aiyipada','You do not have permission to send this test email.'=>'Iwọ ko ni aṣẹ lati fi imeeli idanwo yii ranṣẹ.','Test email could not be sent.'=>'A ko le fi imeeli idanwo ranṣẹ.','Please enter a valid email address to send the test to.'=>'Jọwọ tẹ adirẹsi imeeli to wulo lati fi idanwo ranṣẹ si.','[Test] %s'=>'[Idanwo] %s','Test email sent to %s.'=>'Imeeli idanwo ti fi ranṣẹ si %s.','Test email failed to send. Check your email/SMTP settings and try again.'=>'Imeeli idanwo ko le fi ranṣẹ. Ṣayẹwo awọn eto imeeli/SMTP rẹ ki o tun gbiyanju.','Reports & Notifications'=>'Awọn Iroyin & Ikilọ','Order Received Confirmation'=>'Ẹri Gbigba Ọrẹ','Subscription Renewal Failed'=>'Ìforúkọsílẹ Kò Ṣeé Ṣe','Enable Facebook Ad Events'=>'Mu Awọn iṣẹlẹ Ipolowo Facebook ṣiṣẹ','Google Analytics Purchase Event Tracking'=>'Iwadi iṣẹlẹ rira Google Analytics','Currency & Pricing'=>'Owó & Iye','Pages & Customer Account'=>'Awọn Oju-iwe & Akọọlẹ Onibara','Company & Branding'=>'Ile-iṣẹ & Ami','Other Settings'=>'Awọn Eto Miiran','Classic card form'=>'Fọọmu kaadi atijọ','Legacy'=>'Iṣẹ-ṣiṣe atijọ','Recommended'=>'Ti ṣeduro','Stripe-hosted page'=>'Oju-iwe ti a gbalejo nipasẹ Stripe','Redirects customers to a Stripe-hosted payment page. Most payment methods available (Klarna, Cash App Pay, and more via your Stripe dashboard).'=>'Yipada awọn onibara si oju-iwe isanwo ti a gbalejo nipasẹ Stripe. Ọpọlọpọ awọn ọna isanwo wa (Klarna, Cash App Pay, ati diẹ sii nipasẹ dashboard Stripe rẹ).','Built into Payment Element'=>'Ti wa ni ikole sinu Ẹya Isanwo','Built into the Stripe-hosted page'=>'Ti wa ni ikole sinu oju-iwe ti a gbalejo nipasẹ Stripe','Stripe Connect server URL is not configured.'=>'URL olupin Stripe Connect ko ti ṣeto.','Stripe Connect live mode requires HTTPS for the site and return URL.'=>'Ipo laaye Stripe Connect nilo HTTPS fun aaye ati URL ipadabọ.','Unable to generate an encryption key for Stripe Connect.'=>'A ko le ṣe agbejade bọtini ikọkọ fun Stripe Connect.','Connect server did not return a valid Stripe account ID.'=>'Asopọ olupin ko pada ID akọọlẹ Stripe to wulo.','This Stripe Connect session is missing or expired. This can happen after a failed, abandoned, or restarted connection attempt. Reload this settings page and start the connection again.'=>'Iye akoko asopọ Stripe yii ti sọnu tabi ti pari. Eyi le ṣẹlẹ lẹhin igbiyanju asopọ ti o kuna, ti a fi silẹ, tabi ti bẹrẹ lẹẹkansi. Tun oju-iwe eto yii ṣe ati bẹrẹ asopọ naa lẹẹkansi.','SSL verification failed when retrieving keys from the connect server. Use a trusted certificate, or explicitly enable insecure local credential pickup for non-live local development.'=>'Ijẹrisi SSL kuna nigbati o n gba awọn bọtini lati ọdọ olupin asopọ. Lo iwe-ẹri ti a gba, tabi mu irọrun gbigba ẹri agbegbe ti ko ni aabo ṣiṣẹ fun idagbasoke agbegbe ti kii ṣe laaye.','Unable to retrieve Stripe API keys from the Connect server for this session. Reload this settings page and start the connection again.'=>'Ko le gba awọn bọtini API Stripe lati ọdọ olupin asopọ fun akoko yii. Tun oju-iwe eto yii ṣe ati bẹrẹ asopọ naa lẹẹkansi.','Stripe account connected successfully.'=>'Akọọlẹ Stripe ti sopọ ni aṣeyọri.','Reconnect with Stripe'=>'Tun sopọ pẹlu Stripe','Connect with Stripe'=>'Sopọ pẹlu Stripe','Connect server not configured'=>'Sopọ olupin ko ti ṣeto','Set PPCART_STRIPE_CONNECT_SERVER_URL to your PublishPress intermediary URL.'=>'Set PPCART_STRIPE_CONNECT_SERVER_URL si URL alagbawo PublishPress rẹ.','1. Connect your Stripe account'=>'1. So akọọlẹ Stripe rẹ pọ','We sync your API keys automatically, then walk you through the webhook.'=>'A n ṣepọ awọn bọtini API rẹ laifọwọyi, lẹhinna a yoo dari ọ nipasẹ webhook.','Your saved keys are not direct Stripe keys, so reconnect before you continue.'=>'Awọn bọtini ti o fipamọ rẹ kii ṣe awọn bọtini Stripe taara, nitorina tun so pọ ki o to tẹsiwaju.','Stripe checkout is disabled. You can still connect now.'=>'Iṣowo Stripe ti wa ni pipa. O le tun so pọ ni bayi.','2. Install the webhook'=>'2. Fi webhook sii','Available after you connect.'=>'Wa lẹhin ti o so pọ.','Disconnect'=>'Pipade','Open in Stripe Dashboard'=>'Ṣii ninu Stripe Dashboard','Stripe is ready'=>'Stripe ti ṣetan','Keys synced'=>'Awọn bọtini ti ni asopọ','Webhook active with %d events'=>'Webhook ṣiṣẹ pẹlu %d iṣẹlẹ','1. Stripe account connected'=>'1. Akọọlẹ Stripe ti so pọ','Orders will not complete until this is done.'=>'Awọn aṣẹ ko ni pari titi ti eyi yoo fi ṣẹlẹ.','Needs attention'=>'Nilo akiyesi','Not installed'=>'Ko ti fi sii','Fix the events'=>'Ṣatunṣe awọn iṣẹlẹ','Always enabled for PayPal API requests.'=>'Nigbagbogbo jẹ ki o ṣiṣẹ fun awọn ibeere PayPal API.','Leave blank to keep current value'=>'Fi silẹ fun lati pa iye lọwọlọwọ','Configured (value hidden)'=>'Ti ṣeto (iye ti a pamọ)','Mailchimp API Key'=>'Mailchimp API Bọtini','ActiveCampaign URL'=>'ActiveCampaign URL','ActiveCampaign Secret Key'=>'ActiveCampaign Bọtini Ẹ̀rọ','MemberVault URL'=>'MemberVault URL','MemberVault API Key'=>'MemberVault API Bọtini','SendFox API Key'=>'SendFox API Bọtini','MailPoet is active. Assign lists on each product’s Integrations settings — no API key is required.'=>'MailPoet ti wa ni iṣẹ. Yan awọn atokọ lori awọn eto Isopọ ọja kọọkan — ko si bọtini API ti a nilo.','Install and activate the MailPoet plugin to sync customers to lists. No API key is required.'=>'Fi sori ẹrọ ati muu ṣiṣẹ MailPoet plugin lati sopọ awọn alabara si awọn atokọ. Ko si bọtini API ti a nilo.','Meta Pixel ID'=>'ID Meta Pixel','Enter the numeric Pixel ID to load Meta Pixel on checkout and paid confirmation pages. Leave blank if your site already loads Meta Pixel.'=>'Tẹ ID Pixel ti o ni nọmba lati gbe Meta Pixel lori oju-iwe rira ati awọn oju-iwe ijẹrisi isanwo. Fi silẹ ti aaye rẹ ti gbe Meta Pixel tẹlẹ.','Initiate Checkout'=>'Bẹrẹ Rira','Sends an InitiateCheckout event to an existing Meta Pixel installation when the checkout form is displayed.'=>'Firanṣẹ iṣẹlẹ BẹrẹRira si fifi sori Meta Pixel ti o wa tẹlẹ nigbati fọọmu rira ba han.','Add Payment Info'=>'Fikun-un Alaye Ìsanwó','Sends an AddPaymentInfo event to an existing Meta Pixel installation.'=>'Nṣiṣẹ iṣẹlẹ AddPaymentInfo si fifi sori Meta Pixel ti o wa.','Requires a Meta Pixel ID above or an existing Meta Pixel installation.'=>'Nilo ID Meta Pixel ti o wa loke tabi fifi sori Meta Pixel ti o wa tẹlẹ.','Purchase Complete'=>'Ra Pari','Sends a Purchase event to an existing Meta Pixel installation.'=>'Nṣiṣẹ iṣẹlẹ Rà lati fifi sori Meta Pixel ti o wa.','Lead Captured'=>'Oludari ti a gba','Sends a Lead event when a two-step checkout captures customer details.'=>'Nṣiṣẹ iṣẹlẹ Lead nigbati isanwo igbesẹ meji ba mu alaye alabara.','Sends a purchase event to an existing Google Analytics or Data Layer installation.'=>'Nṣiṣẹ iṣẹlẹ rira si fifi sori Google Analytics tabi Data Layer ti o wa.','Requires Google Analytics, Google Tag Manager, or another plugin/theme to load ga, gtag, or dataLayer on the checkout page.'=>'Nilo Google Analytics, Google Tag Manager, tabi plugin/theme miiran lati gbe ga, gtag, tabi dataLayer lori oju-iwe isanwo.','Sends a generate_lead event when a two-step checkout captures customer details.'=>'Nṣiṣẹ iṣẹlẹ generate_lead nigbati isanwo igbesẹ meji ba mu alaye alabara.','Type'=>'Iru','Choose the event format that matches the analytics script already installed on this site.'=>'Yan ọna kika iṣẹlẹ ti o baamu iwe afọwọkọ itupalẹ ti a ti fi sori ẹrọ tẹlẹ lori aaye yii.','analytics.js'=>'analytics.js','Google Analytics 4'=>'Google Analytics 4','Universal Analytics'=>'Universal Analytics','DataLayer with GA4'=>'DataLayer pẹ̀lú GA4','DataLayer with Enhanced Ecommerce (UA)'=>'DataLayer pẹ̀lú Ecommerce Tó Gbooro (UA)','If you like %1$s, please leave us a %2$s rating. Thank you!'=>'Ti o ba fẹ́ %1$s, jọwọ fi wa silẹ àyẹyẹ %2$s. Ẹ ṣéun!','About PublishPress Cart'=>'Nipa PublishPress Cart','PublishPress Cart Documentation'=>'Iwe afọwọkọ PublishPress Cart','Contact the PublishPress team'=>'Kan si ẹgbẹ PublishPress','Contact PublishPress'=>'Kan si PublishPress','Categories'=>'Ẹka','Tags'=>'Tẹ́gí','Welcome to %s'=>'Kaabọ si %s','To get started, head over to the settings page to connect your Stripe account and select your currency. Once that\'s done, you\'ll be ready to create your first product!'=>'Lati bẹrẹ, lọ si oju-iwe eto lati sopọ iroyin Stripe rẹ ki o yan owo rẹ. Lẹ́yìn ti a ti ṣe eyi, iwọ yoo ti ṣetan lati ṣẹda ọja rẹ akọkọ!','Get Started!'=>'Bẹrẹ!','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'E jọwọ, o ko ni ẹtọ lati wọle si oju-iwe yii.','Tax Options'=>'Awọn aṣayan Owo-ori','Invoice Options'=>'Awọn aṣayan Iwe-owo','The Stripe Connect server could not preregister this session. Error: %s'=>'Olutọju Stripe Connect ko le preregister akoko yii. Aṣiṣe: %s','The Stripe Connect server rejected this preregistration request.'=>'Olutọju Stripe Connect kọ ibeere preregistration yii.','Unable to prepare the Stripe Connect site credential.'=>'Ko le mura awọn iwe-ẹri aaye Stripe Connect.','Unable to encrypt the Stripe Connect site credential.'=>'Ko le ṣe ẹniti awọn iwe-ẹri aaye Stripe Connect.','Unable to fetch the Stripe Connect preregistration public key. Error: %s'=>'Ko le gba bọtini gbogbogbo preregistration Stripe Connect. Aṣiṣe: %s','The Stripe Connect preregistration public key is unavailable or invalid.'=>'Bọtini gbogbogbo preregistration Stripe Connect ko wa tabi ko tọ.','Stripe account disconnected for the selected mode.'=>'A ti ge asopọ akọọlẹ Stripe fun ipo ti a yan.','Affiliate Addon activated successfully.'=>'Àfikún alafaramo ti ṣiṣẹ́ daradara.','Affiliate Addon deactivated successfully.'=>'Àfikún alafaramo ti dawọ́ ṣiṣẹ́ daradara.','Affiliate Addon activation failed.'=>'Ìṣàkóso àfikún alafaramo kọ́lu.','Affiliate Addon deactivation failed.'=>'Ìdawọ́ àfikún alafaramo kọ́lu.','Mollie Addon activated successfully.'=>'Àfikún Mollie ti ṣiṣẹ́ daradara.','Mollie Addon deactivated successfully.'=>'Mollie Addon ti wa ni pa aṣẹ ni aṣeyọri.','Mollie Addon activation failed.'=>'Mollie Addon aṣẹ ko ni aṣeyọri.','Mollie Addon deactivation failed.'=>'Mollie Addon pa aṣẹ ko ni aṣeyọri.','Razorpay Addon activated successfully.'=>'Razorpay Addon ti wa ni pa aṣẹ ni aṣeyọri.','Razorpay Addon deactivated successfully.'=>'Razorpay Addon ti wa ni pa aṣẹ ni aṣeyọri.','Razorpay Addon activation failed.'=>'Razorpay Addon aṣẹ ko ni aṣeyọri.','Razorpay Addon deactivation failed.'=>'Razorpay Addon pa aṣẹ ko ni aṣeyọri.','Square Addon activated successfully.'=>'Square Addon ti wa ni pa aṣẹ ni aṣeyọri.','Square Addon deactivated successfully.'=>'Square Addon ti wa ni pa aṣẹ ni aṣeyọri.','Square Addon activation failed.'=>'Square Addon aṣẹ ko ni aṣeyọri.','Square Addon deactivation failed.'=>'Square Addon pa aṣẹ ko ni aṣeyọri.','New order manually created by %s'=>'Aṣẹ tuntun ti a ṣẹda laifọwọyi nipasẹ %s','Order updated by %s'=>'Aṣẹ ti ni imudojuiwọn nipasẹ %s','Copied'=>'Ti daakọ','Copy failed'=>'Daakọ kuna','Required fields missing:'=>'Awọn ọwọn ti a nilo ti ṣofo:','Configuration error: Missing AJAX settings. Please refresh the page.'=>'Aṣiṣe ìkonpẹ́: Àwọn àṣàyàn AJAX nìkan ni. Jọ̀wọ́ tún ojú-ìwé náà ṣe.','Subscription ID is missing.'=>'ID ìkànsí nìkan ni.','Sync subscription with Stripe?'=>'Ṣe ìkànsí pọ̀ pẹ̀lú Stripe?','Wait...'=>'Dúró...','Error: Please try again.'=>'Aṣiṣe: Jọ̀wọ́ tún gbìmọ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi.','Migration required'=>'Iṣipopada nilo','You have 1 stored credential in plaintext. After enabling encryption, run migration from Settings → Maintenance to encrypt it.'=>'O ni 1 iwe-ẹri ti o tọju ni ọrọ-ọrọ. Lẹhin ti muu ṣiṣẹ ẹniti, ṣiṣe iṣipopada lati Eto → Itọju lati ṣe encrypt rẹ.','You have %d stored credentials in plaintext. After enabling encryption, run migration from Settings → Maintenance to encrypt them.'=>'O ni %d iwe-ẹri ti o tọju ni ọrọ-ọrọ. Lẹhin ti muu ṣiṣẹ ẹniti, ṣiṣe iṣipopada lati Eto → Itọju lati ṣe encrypt wọn.','Encryption updated'=>'Encryption ti ni imudojuiwọn','Continue'=>'Tẹsiwaju','OK'=>'OK','Unable to update security encryption setting.'=>'Ko le ṣe imudojuiwọn eto encryption aabo.','No matching customers'=>'Ko si awọn alabara ti o baamu','No matching products'=>'Ko si awọn ọja ti o baamu','Searching…'=>'N wa…','No matching settings'=>'Ko sí àwọn àṣàyàn tó bá mu','Try a different keyword or clear the search to see all settings.'=>'Ṣe àyẹ̀wò ọrọìsà míì tàbí sọ ìwádìí di ofurufu láti rí gbogbo àṣàyàn.','Discard your unsaved changes?'=>'Ṣe fẹ́ kí a fọ́ àwọn ayipada rẹ̀ tí a kò fipamọ́?','Reset this email template to the built-in default?'=>'Ṣe fẹ́ kí a tún àpẹrẹ imeeli yìí ṣe sí ìtọ́kasí àkọ́kọ́?','Generating preview...'=>'Ṣe ìmúlẹ̀ yìí...','Email preview could not be generated. Please refresh the page and try again.'=>'Ìmúlẹ̀ imeeli kò lè ṣẹ́ṣẹ̀. Jọ̀wọ́ tún ojú-ìwé náà ṣe ki o tún gbìmọ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan síi.','Close Preview'=>'Pa Ìmúlẹ̀','Encrypt stored credentials'=>'Encrypt awọn iwe-ẹri ti o tọju','Encrypt %d plaintext credential(s) in the database? Take a backup first and run this during a maintenance window.'=>'Encrypt %d iwe-ẹri ọrọ-ọrọ ni ibi ipamọ data? Gba afẹyinti akọkọ ki o si ṣiṣẹ eyi ni window itọju.','Scan stored credentials and encrypt any plaintext values? Take a backup first and run this during a maintenance window.'=>'Ṣayẹwo awọn iwe-ẹri ti o tọju ki o encrypt eyikeyi iye ọrọ-ọrọ? Gba afẹyinti akọkọ ki o si ṣiṣẹ eyi ni window itọju.','Uploading file…'=>'N gbe faili…','File uploaded successfully.'=>'Faili ti gbe silẹ ni aṣeyọri.','Upload failed. Please try again.'=>'Gbe silẹ kuna. Jọwọ gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','Generating preview…'=>'N ṣẹda afihan…','Sending test email…'=>'N firanṣẹ imeeli idanwo…','Test email failed to send. Please refresh the page and try again.'=>'Imeeli idanwo kuna lati firanṣẹ. Jọwọ tun ṣe oju-iwe naa ki o si gbiyanju lẹẹkansi.','Enter an email address to send the test to.'=>'Tẹ adirẹsi imeeli kan lati firanṣẹ idanwo si.','Tax rate ID: %s'=>'ID oṣuwọn owo-ori: %s','No matching tax rates found.'=>'Ko si awọn oṣuwọn owo-ori ti o baamu ti a rii.','%s items'=>'%s awọn nkan','First page'=>'Oju-iwe akọkọ','Previous page'=>'Oju-iwe ti tẹlẹ','Current page'=>'Oju-iwe lọwọlọwọ','Pagination%1$s of %2$s'=>'%1$s ti %2$s','Next page'=>'Ibi oju-iwe to nbọ','Last page'=>'Ibi oju-iwe to kẹhin','Mailchimp groups sync error: %s'=>'Aṣiṣe sọdọtun Mailchimp groups: %s','Mailchimp tags sync error: %s'=>'Aṣiṣe sọdọtun Mailchimp tags: %s','Invalid Request'=>'Ìbéèrè Àìtọ́','Missing Fields'=>'Àwọn Ààyè Tí Kò Sẹ́yìn','No groups found'=>'Kò sí ẹgbẹ́ tó rí','%s integration error.'=>'%s aṣiṣe isopọ.','Unable to connect to the integration(s) listed below. Go to the %1$s <a href="%2$s" rel="noreferrer noopener" data-testid="ppcart-admin-notice-integration-settings">settings page</a> to check your integration settings.</p>'=>'Ko le sopọ si isopọ (s) ti a ṣe akojọ silẹ ni isalẹ. Lọ si %1$s <a href="%2$s" rel="noreferrer noopener" data-testid="ppcart-admin-notice-integration-settings">oju-iwe eto</a> lati ṣayẹwo awọn eto isopọ rẹ.</p>','Stripe Connect is enabled, but the destination account is missing for the active API mode.'=>'Sopọ Stripe ti wa ni mu ṣiṣẹ, ṣugbọn akọọlẹ ibi-afẹde ko si fun ipo API ti n ṣiṣẹ.','Use the Connect with Stripe button in Stripe settings to connect an account for this mode.'=>'Lo bọtini Sopọ pẹlu Stripe ninu awọn eto Stripe lati sopọ akọọlẹ fun ipo yii.','Stripe Connect destination account format is invalid.'=>'Fọọmu akọọlẹ ibi-afẹde Sopọ Stripe ko tọ.','Use a connected account ID that starts with acct_. Values like ca_ are not valid destinations.'=>'Lo ID akọọlẹ ti o so ti o bẹrẹ pẹlu acct_. Awọn iye bii ca_ ko jẹ awọn ibi-afẹde to tọ.','Stripe reconnect required for the active API mode.'=>'Ipadabọ Stripe nilo fun ipo API ti n ṣiṣẹ.','Stripe keys are missing or not readable. Use Connect with Stripe to sync direct keys.'=>'Awọn bọtini Stripe ko si tabi ko le ka. Lo Sopọ pẹlu Stripe lati mu awọn bọtini taara pọ.','Stripe is using legacy credentials that are not stored as direct Stripe keys. Use Connect with Stripe before removing payment decryptor support.'=>'Stripe n lo awọn iwe-ẹri atijọ ti a ko tọju gẹgẹbi awọn bọtini Stripe taara. Lo Connect pẹlu Stripe ṣaaju ki o to yọ atilẹyin decryptor isanwo kuro.','Stripe secret key is missing for the active API mode.'=>'Bọtini aṣiri Stripe ti sọnu fun ipo API ti n ṣiṣẹ.','Connect status could not be verified without a Stripe secret key.'=>'Ipo asopọ ko le jẹrisi laisi bọtini aṣiri Stripe.','Stripe Connect status:'=>'Ipo asopọ Stripe:','Connected account is fully enabled for charges and payouts.'=>'Akọọlẹ asopọ ti wa ni kikun mu ṣiṣẹ fun awọn idiyele ati awọn isanwo.','Stripe Connect status requires attention.'=>'Ipo asopọ Stripe nilo ifojusi.','charges_enabled: %1$s, payouts_enabled: %2$s, currently_due: %3$d, past_due: %4$d.'=>'charges_enabled: %1$s, payouts_enabled: %2$s, currently_due: %3$d, past_due: %4$d.','Open connected account in Stripe'=>'Ṣii akọọlẹ asopọ ninu Stripe','Stripe Connect status check failed.'=>'Ayẹwo ipo asopọ Stripe kuna.','Field'=>'Field','Enter a value. This field is required.'=>'Tẹ iye kan. Ẹka yii jẹ dandan.','1 required field is empty'=>'1 aaye dandan ti ṣofo','%d required fields are empty'=>'%d aaye dandan ni ṣofo','Some required fields are empty.'=>'Diẹ ninu awọn aaye dandan ni ṣofo.','Fill them in, then save the product again.'=>'Fọwọsi wọn, lẹhinna fipamọ ọja naa lẹẹkansi.','and %d more'=>'ati %d si i','Product settings: some required fields are empty.'=>'Awọn eto ọja: diẹ ninu awọn aaye dandan ni ṣofo.','Show fields'=>'Fihan awọn aaye','[removed]'=>'[yọkuro]','There was a problem removing your %1$s from order #%2$d.'=>'Iṣoro kan wa ni yiyọ %1$s rẹ lati aṣẹ #%2$d.','<p class="privacy-policy-tutorial">This sample language includes the basics around what personal data your PublishPress Cart installation may be collecting, storing and sharing, as well as who may have access to that data. Depending on what settings are enabled and which additional plugins are used, the specific information shared by your site will vary. We recommend consulting with a lawyer when deciding what information to disclose on your privacy policy.</p>
<h2>What we collect and store</h2>
<p>We collect information about you during the checkout process as well as some basic activities such as the dates you make purchases, or cancel your subscriptions with us.</p>
<p>While you visit our site, we’ll track:</p>
<ul>
   <li>— Products you’ve viewed:  we’ll use this to, for example, send you reminders about products you’ve recently viewed</li>
   <li>— IP address: we’ll use this for purposes like tracking which products you\'ve purchased and what discounts you’re eligible for</li>
   <li>— Name, email and physical address: we’ll ask you to enter this so we can communicate with you about your order and deliver your order to you!</li>
</ul>
<p>When you purchase from us, we’ll ask you to provide information including your name, billing/shipping address, email address, phone number, credit card/payment details and optional account information like username and password. We’ll use this information for purposes, such as, to:</p>
<ul>
   <li>— Send you information about your account and order</li>
   <li>— Respond to your requests, including refunds and complaints</li>
   <li>— Process payments and prevent fraud</li>
   <li>— Set up your account for our store</li>
   <li>— Improve our store offerings</li>
   <li>— Send you marketing messages, if you choose to receive them</li>
</ul>
<p>If you create an account, we will store your name, address, email and phone number, which will be used to populate the checkout for future orders.</p>
<p>We generally store information about you for as long as we need the information for the purposes for which we collect and use it, and we are not legally required to continue to keep it. For example, we will store order information for XXX years for tax and accounting purposes. This includes your name, email address and billing/shipping address.</p>
<h2>Who on our team has access</h2>
<p>Members of our team have access to the information you provide us. For example, site Owner/Administrators can access:</p>
<ul>
   <li>— Order information like what was purchased, subscription information, payment dates and amounts, and</li>
   <li>— Customer information like your name, username / email address, and address information.</li>
</ul>
<p>Our team members have access to this information to help fulfill orders, process refunds and support you.</p>
<h2>What we share with others</h2>
<p><em>
  In this section you should list who you’re sharing data with, and for what purpose. This could include, but may not be limited to, analytics/reporting tools, marketing services (such as email services like MailChimp, ActiveCampaign or Kit), payment gateways, and third party embeds.
</em></p>
<p><em>
We share information with third parties who help us provide additional contact services to you; for example – [enter your third party platforms such as Analytics, Email Marketing, or any others and short description of their purpose. If you have a DPA from that service, this would be a good place to include that also.]
</em></p>
<h3>Payments</h3>
<p class="privacy-policy-tutorial">In this subsection you should list which third party payment processors you’re using to take payments on your store since these may handle customer data. We’ve included Stripe as an example, but you should remove this if you’re not using Stripe.</p>
<p>We accept payments through Stripe. When processing payments, some of your data will be passed to Stripe, including information required to process or support the payment, such as the purchase total and billing information.</p>
<p>Please see the <a href="https://stripe.com/privacy">Stripe Privacy Policy</a> for more details.</p>'=>'<p class="privacy-policy-tutorial">Eyi jẹ́ àpẹẹrẹ èdè tó ní ìmọ̀ nípa ìmọ̀ràn ẹni kọọkan tí fifi sori PublishPress Cart rẹ̀ lè máa gba, tọ́jú, àti pin, pẹ̀lú ẹni tó lè ní iraye si ìmọ̀ yẹn. Gẹ́gẹ́ bí àwọn àṣàyàn tí a ti mu ṣiṣẹ́ àti àwọn afikun tó jẹ́ míì tí a ṣe, ìmọ̀ pàtó tó pin nipasẹ ojú-ìwé rẹ̀ máa yàtọ̀. A ṣàbẹwò láti bá agbẹjọ́rò kan sọrọ nígbà tí a bá n pinnu ohun tó yẹ kí a sọ nípa ìpolówó ìmọ̀ràn rẹ.</p>
<h2>Ohun tí a gba àti tọ́jú</h2>
<p>A gba ìmọ̀ nípa rẹ̀ nígbà ìlànà rira bíi àwọn iṣẹ́ ipilẹ bíi ọjọ́ tí o ṣe ra, tàbí fagilé ìkànsí rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú wa.</p>
<p>Nígbà tí o bá ṣàbẹwò ojú-ìwé wa, a máa tọ́pinpin:</p>
<ul>
   <li>— Àwọn ọja tí o ti wo: a máa lo eyi láti, fún àpẹẹrẹ, ránṣẹ́ sí ọ nípa àwọn ọja tí o ti wo laipẹ́</li>
   <li>— Àdírẹ́s IP: a máa lo eyi fún àwọn ìdí bíi tọ́pinpin àwọn ọja tí o ti ra àti ohun ìdíyelé tí o yẹ kí o gba</li>
   <li>— Orúkọ, imeeli àti àdírẹ́s gidi: a máa béèrè pé ki o tẹ̀ síbẹ̀ kí a lè bá ọ sọrọ nípa àṣẹ rẹ̀ àti fi àṣẹ rẹ̀ ranṣẹ́ sí ọ!</li>
</ul>
<p>Nígbà tí o bá ra lọ́wọ́ wa, a máa béèrè pé ki o pese ìmọ̀ tó ní àkópọ̀ orúkọ rẹ, àdírẹ́s ìsanwo/ìfiránṣẹ́, àdírẹ́s imeeli, nômba tẹ́lèfóònù, àkàǹtì kaadi/ìsanwo àti ìmọ̀ àkàǹtì àṣàyàn bí orúkọ olumulo ati ọrọìsirò. A máa lo ìmọ̀ yìí fún àwọn ìdí, gẹ́gẹ́ bí, láti:</p>
<ul>
   <li>— Ránṣẹ́ sí ọ nípa àkàǹtì rẹ̀ àti àṣẹ</li>
   <li>— Fesi sí àwọn ìbéèrè rẹ, pẹ̀lú àwọn agbapada àti ẹjọ́</li>
   <li>— Ṣe ìsanwo àti dáàbò bo ìtanràn</li>
   <li>— Ṣeto àkàǹtì rẹ fún ìtajà wa</li>
   <li>— Mu ìpese ìtajà wa pọ si</li>
   <li>— Ránṣẹ́ sí ọ nípa ìkìlọ̀ tita, bí o bá yàn láti gba wọn</li>
</ul>
<p>Tí o bá dá àkàǹtì kan, a máa tọ́jú orúkọ rẹ, àdírẹ́s, imeeli àti nômba tẹ́lèfóònù rẹ, tó máa jẹ́ ìmọ̀ tó máa fi hàn nígbà ìlànà rira fún àwọn àṣẹ tó n bọ.</p>
<p>A n tọ́jú ìmọ̀ nípa rẹ fún gbogbo igba tí a bá nílò ìmọ̀ yẹn fún àwọn ìdí tó jẹ́ pé a gba àti lo, a kò sí ní bẹ̀rẹ̀ sí ní títọ́jú rẹ. Fún àpẹẹrẹ, a máa tọ́jú ìmọ̀ àṣẹ fún XXX ọdún fún ìdí owó-ori àti ìṣirò. Eyi ní orúkọ rẹ, àdírẹ́s imeeli àti àdírẹ́s ìsanwo/ìfiránṣẹ́.</p>
<h2>Ta ni ní ẹgbẹ́ wa tó ní iraye si</h2>
<p>Àwọn ọmọ ẹgbẹ́ wa ní iraye si ìmọ̀ tí o fún wa. Fún àpẹẹrẹ, Olùní ojú-ìwé/Àmúgbá le ní iraye si:</p>
<ul>
   <li>— Ìmọ̀ àṣẹ bí ohun tí a ra, ìmọ̀ ìkànsí, ọjọ́ àti iye ìsanwo, àti</li>
   <li>— Ìmọ̀ oníbàárà bí orúkọ rẹ, orúkọ olumulo/imeeli, àti ìmọ̀ àdírẹ́s.</li>
</ul>
<p>Àwọn ọmọ ẹgbẹ́ wa ní iraye si ìmọ̀ yìí láti ran ẹ́ lọwọ láti fọwọ́sowọpọ̀ àwọn àṣẹ, ṣe agbapada àti ṣe atilẹyin fún ọ.</p>
<h2>Ohun tí a pin pẹ̀lú àwọn mìíràn</h2>
<p><em>
  Nínú apá yìí, o yẹ kí o kàkọ́ nípa ẹnikẹ́ni tí o n pin ìmọ̀ pẹ̀lú, àti fún kí ni. Eyi lè ní, ṣùgbọ́n kò lé ni kó, àwọn irinṣẹ́ àtúntò/ìròyìn, iṣẹ́ tita (bíi iṣẹ́ imeeli bí MailChimp, ActiveCampaign tàbí Kit), àwọn ilẹ̀kùn ìsanwo, àti àwọn ìkànsí ẹlòmíràn.
</em></p>
<p><em>
A pin ìmọ̀ pẹ̀lú àwọn ẹlòmíràn tó ṣe iranlọwọ fún wa láti pese àwọn iṣẹ́ ìbánisọ̀rọ̀ míì sí ọ; fún àpẹẹrẹ – [tẹ̀ síbẹ̀ àwọn pẹpẹ ẹlòmíràn rẹ bíi Àtúntò, Tita Imeeli, tàbí àwọn mìíràn àti àpejuwe kékèké ti ìdí wọn. Tí o bá ní DPA láti iṣẹ́ yẹn, eyi jẹ́ ibi tó dára láti fi kún un náà.]
</em></p>
<h3>Ìsanwo</h3>
<p class="privacy-policy-tutorial">Nínú apá yìí, o yẹ kí o kàkọ́ nípa àwọn aṣàyàn ìsanwo ẹlòmíràn tí o n lo láti gba ìsanwo ní ìtajà rẹ, níwọ̀n bí wọ́n lè ní ìmọ̀ oníbàárà. A ti fi Stripe gẹ́gẹ́ bí àpẹẹrẹ, ṣùgbọ́n o yẹ kí o yọ́kúrò ní eyi tí o kò bá n lo Stripe.</p>
<p>A n gba ìsanwo nípasẹ̀ Stripe. Nígbà ìṣàkóso ìsanwo, diẹ ninu ìmọ̀ rẹ yóò lọ sí Stripe, pẹ̀lú ìmọ̀ tí a nílò láti ṣe ìṣàkóso tàbí ṣe atilẹyin ìsanwo, bíi apapọ rira àti ìmọ̀ ìsanwo.</p>
<p>Jọ̀wọ́ wo <a href="https://stripe.com/privacy">Ìpolówó ìmọ̀ràn Stripe</a> fún àlàyé diẹ sii.</p></source>
