ẹ','Subscriptions Canceled'=>'Iwe-aṣẹ ti fagile','Coming up for the week of'=>'Ti n bọ fun ọsẹ ti','Coming up for'=>'Ti n bọ fun','Nothing found for this time period'=>'Kò sí ohun tí a rí fún àsìkò yìí','Encryption enabled'=>'Ìpamọ́ ti a ṣiṣẹ́','Payment and integration credentials are encrypted at rest.'=>'Ìsanwó àti ìfọwọ́sowọpọ́ àṣẹ ni a ti pa mọ́ ní ipò ìsinmi.','New credentials will be encrypted when saved.'=>'Àṣẹ tuntun yóò jẹ́ kí a pa mọ́ nígbà tí a bá fipamọ́.','Encryption disabled'=>'Ìpamọ́ ti a pa mọ́','Payment and integration keys are stored in plaintext by default. Enable encryption to reduce risk if your database is exposed.'=>'Ìsanwó àti àwọn bọtìnì ìfọwọ́sowọpọ́ ni a tọju ní àkọsílẹ́ àfihàn pẹ̀lú àkọ́kọ́. Ṣíṣe ìpamọ́ láti dín ewu kù bí ìkànsí rẹ bá han.','Enable encryption'=>'Ṣíṣe ìpamọ́','Add %s to wp-config.php to enable encryption.'=>'Fi %s kun wp-config.php láti jẹ́ kí ìpamọ́ ṣiṣẹ́.','Encryption is controlled by PPCART_ENCRYPT_SECRETS in wp-config.php.'=>'Ìpamọ́ ni a ṣàkóso nipasẹ PPCART_ENCRYPT_SECRETS ní wp-config.php.','Optional: lock encryption on in wp-config.php with %s'=>'Àṣàyàn: di ìpamọ́ mọ́ ní wp-config.php pẹ̀lú %s','Open Security settings'=>'Ṣí ìtọ́ni Ààbò','Encryption'=>'Ìpamọ́','Controlled by PPCART_ENCRYPT_SECRETS in wp-config.php. The database setting is ignored.'=>'A ṣe àkóso rẹ̀ pẹ̀lú PPCART_ENCRYPT_SECRETS ní wp-config.php. Àwọn àṣàyàn ìkànsí ni a foju kọ.','Encrypt payment and integration credentials in the database'=>'Pa àwọn àṣẹ ìsanwó àti ìfọwọ́sowọpọ́ mọ́ ní àkóónú','For production sites, you can lock this in wp-config.php instead:'=>'Fún àwọn ojú-ìwé iṣelọpọ, o lè di èyí mọ́ ní wp-config.php dipo:','When that constant is defined, it takes precedence and this checkbox is ignored.'=>'Nígbà tí a bá ṣàlàyé àkọ́kọ́ yẹn, ó gba ọkàn àṣẹ, a sì foju kọ́ àyípadà yìí.','Key source: %s'=>'Orísun bọtìnì: %s','Encryption cannot run until AUTH_KEY or PPCART_SECRETS_KEY is configured in wp-config.php.'=>'Ìpamọ́ kò le ṣiṣẹ́ títí di pé AUTH_KEY tàbí PPCART_SECRETS_KEY ti wà ní wp-config.php.','Stored credentials'=>'Àwọn àṣẹ tí a fipamọ́','Encrypted: %d'=>'Ìpamọ́: %d','Plaintext: %d'=>'Àkọsílẹ́ àfihàn: %d','While encryption is disabled, new and updated credentials are stored in plaintext. Existing encrypted values are not rewritten automatically; Cart continues to read them normally.'=>'Nígbà tí ìpamọ́ ti pa mọ́, àwọn àṣẹ tuntun àti ti a ṣe àtúnṣe ni a tọju ní àkọsílẹ́ àfihàn. Àwọn iye tí a ti pa mọ́ ti wa ni a kò kọ́ àtúnṣe laifọwọ́si; Káàtì ń ka wọn gẹ́gẹ́ bí àdáni.','When you enable encryption, any plaintext credentials are encrypted automatically.'=>'Nígbà tí o bá ṣe ìpamọ́, gbogbo àṣẹ àfihàn ni a yóò jẹ́ kí a pa mọ́ laifọwọ́si.','Last migration: %s'=>'Ìkànsí ikẹhin: %s','Enable encryption above or in wp-config.php before running migration.'=>'Ṣíṣe ìpamọ́ lórí tàbí ní wp-config.php kí o tó ṣiṣẹ́ ìkànsí.','Rewrites existing plaintext payment and integration credentials in the database. Run during a maintenance window after taking a backup.'=>'Kọ́ àwọn àṣẹ àfihàn ìsanwó àti ìfọwọ́sowọpọ́ tí ó wà ní àkóónú. Ṣiṣẹ́ nígbà àkókò ìtúnṣe lẹ́yìn tí o bá ti mu àkọ́kọ́ àtìbáyé.','PublishPress Cart security'=>'Ààbò PublishPress Káàtì','Encrypted %1$d stored credentials (%2$d skipped, %3$d failed).'=>'Ìpamọ́ %1$d àṣẹ tí a fipamọ́ (%2$d ti a foju kọ́, %3$d ti kuna).','Do not change AUTH_KEY or PPCART_SECRETS_KEY without re-entering payment and integration keys in Cart settings.'=>'Má ṣe yí AUTH_KEY tàbí PPCART_SECRETS_KEY padà láì tún tẹ àṣẹ ìsanwó àti ìfọwọ́sowọpọ́ rẹ̀ ní ìtọ́sọ́kan Káàtì.','Some credentials could not be encrypted. Re-run migration from Cart → Settings → Maintenance or re-save keys manually.'=>'Diẹ̀ lára àwọn àṣẹ kò lè jẹ́ kí a pa mọ́. Tun ṣiṣẹ́ ìkànsí láti Káàtì → Ìtọ́sọ́kan → Ìtúnṣe tàbí tún fipamọ́ bọtìnì ní ọwọ́.','You do not have permission to change security encryption settings.'=>'O kò ní àṣẹ láti yí àtọ́ni ìpamọ́ ààbò sílẹ̀.','Encryption disabled.'=>'Ìpamọ́ ti pa mọ́.','Encryption enabled.'=>'Ìpamọ́ ti ṣiṣẹ́.','Encrypted %1$d stored credentials (%2$d skipped, %3$d failed). Use Encrypt stored credentials in Maintenance to retry failures.'=>'Ìpamọ́ %1$d àṣẹ tí a fipamọ́ (%2$d ti a foju kọ́, %3$d ti kuna). Lo Ṣe ìpamọ́ àṣẹ tí a fipamọ́ ní Ìtúnṣe láti tun gbìmọ̀ kù.','Encrypted %1$d stored credentials (%2$d skipped).'=>'Ìpamọ́ %1$d àṣẹ tí a fipamọ́ (%2$d ti a foju kọ́).','You do not have permission to encrypt stored credentials.'=>'O kò ní àṣẹ láti ṣe ìpamọ́ àṣẹ tí a fipamọ́.','Migration complete. Encrypted: %1$d. Skipped: %2$d. Failed: %3$d.'=>'Ìkànsí ti parí. Ìpamọ́: %1$d. Ti a foju kọ́: %2$d. Ti kuna: %3$d.','Unavailable'=>'Kò sí','Encryption is not enabled. Enable it in Cart → Settings → Maintenance or add define( \'PPCART_ENCRYPT_SECRETS\', true ); to wp-config.php.'=>'Àkóónú kò tii ṣí. Ṣí i ni Cart → Eto → Itọju tabi fi define( \'PPCART_ENCRYPT_SECRETS\', otitọ ); si wp-config.php.','Encryption requires AUTH_KEY or PPCART_SECRETS_KEY in wp-config.php.'=>'Àkóónú nilo AUTH_KEY tabi PPCART_SECRETS_KEY ni wp-config.php.','Stripe payment ID is missing for this order.'=>'ID ìsanwó Stripe ti sọnu fún àṣẹ yìí.','Stripe charge could not be loaded for this order.'=>'Ìyẹ̀wù Stripe kò le ṣe àtúnṣe fún àṣẹ yìí.','Stripe charge could not be matched to this local order.'=>'Ìyẹ̀wù Stripe kò le ba àṣẹ agbegbe yìí mu.','Canceled Stripe subscriptions cannot be resumed locally.'=>'Àwọn ìforúkọsílẹ Stripe ti a fagile kò le tun bẹ̀rẹ̀ ni agbegbe.','Invalid subscription.'=>'Ìforúkọsílẹ̀ tí kò tọ́.','Stripe subscription is not linked to a PublishPress Cart subscription.'=>'Ìforúkọsílẹ Stripe kò ni ìjápọ̀ pẹ̀lú ìforúkọsílẹ PublishPress Cart.','This payment could not be verified. Please reload the page and try again.'=>'Àkọsílẹ yìí kò le jẹ́ ìmú ìmúlẹ̀. Jọ tún ṣe ìkó àtúnṣe náà.','%s order created.'=>'%s àṣẹ ti ṣẹda.','Order complete.'=>'Àṣẹ ti pari.','Creating subscription.'=>'Ṣíṣẹda ìforúkọsílẹ.','Category'=>'Ẹka','Tag'=>'Tẹg','Add New %s'=>'Fikun un Tuntun %s','Edit %s